{
 "title": "安全封装",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "专业系统编程的最佳实践是把 `unsafe` 代码限制在小函数里，向外界提供**完全安全**的 API。调用者永远不必写 `unsafe`，无效输入在封装层就被过滤掉。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "extern \"stdlib.h\" fn rand() -> i32",
    "extern \"stdlib.h\" fn srand(seed: u32)",
    "",
    "fn get_c_random(max: i32) -> i32:",
    "    if max <= 0:",
    "        return 0",
    "    unsafe:",
    "        raw = rand()",
    "        return raw % max",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    dice = get_c_random(6) + 1",
    "    print(\"dice:\", dice)"
   ],
   "run": false,
   "local": true
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "在下面的例子中，C 的 `sqrt` 被隐藏在一个返回 `Result` 的安全函数里："
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "extern \"math.h\" fn sqrt(x: f64) -> f64",
    "",
    "fn square_root(x: f64) -> Result[f64, str]:",
    "    if x < 0.0:",
    "        return Err(\"negative number\")",
    "    unsafe:",
    "        return Ok(sqrt(x))",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    match square_root(16.0):",
    "        Ok(v):",
    "            print(v)",
    "        Err(m):",
    "            print(m)"
   ],
   "run": false,
   "local": true
  },
